夫です！\nどうぞお気軽にご検討いただければ幸いです！\n\nそれでは、よろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/12FqZ7p9thblRDv4KeZVd5VMRWb6caW-g?usp=sharing", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@nehituji21/works/149", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 835558, "client_id": 2638314, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b4f90685/uploads/origins/0825736f-330b-4bd0-a841-831e622370af?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3187823b8d5983e697efedc109375099", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b4f90685/uploads/origins/0825736f-330b-4bd0-a841-831e622370af?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5a5f04aa927a258038d6297facdab8dc", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！\n\n僕のギャル龍「アレキサンドライト」を描いてくれませんか？\n\nhttps://cdn.imgchest.com/files/wye3cj2rnm4.png", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@nehituji21/works/148", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 835558, "client_id": 3062338, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/58502fea/uploads/origins/09d0d50a-f3da-4c09-9d7a-5e60c6196bdf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0d73c3f44542792ca731ce14c06877c1", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/58502fea/uploads/origins/09d0d50a-f3da-4c09-9d7a-5e60c6196bdf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=519449ecb862fcedf4ce2b10cf550178", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！\n\nあなたの画風がとても好きなので、ぜひ私のVTuberケーリーの女性版を描いてほしいです！\n彼女は近未来的なサイバーパンク都市に住む人間と狼のサイボーグです。冷静で優しいお姉さん的存在